omar-frontend: Ping me when sample PR is up, I'll help polish the demo copy and verify the Vercel preview behaves correctly with the shim.

zoe-docs: I'll prep the README patch text and a short changelog blurb for the sample.

nina-ml: Thanks everyone. This should cut down on onboarding tickets.

viv-devex: Thanks — I'll land the sample patch first and open the SDK PR as experimental. Will tag reviewers and add the CI mocks. :sparkles:
